; Exploration HUD (2026-10-01, after Mutant Year Zero, Our Adventurer Guild and Darkest Dungeon):
; room banner top centre; the Party and Journal buttons top right where combat keeps its Journal,
; with the Wardstone, objective and pack (potions, gold) under them; party face cards along the
; bottom with the room's prompts (rest, and camp or the way on only when open) just above them;
; the floor plan in a round frame bottom right. Travel is a click on a doorway, whose hover gives
; the ward cost. Development controls sit top left and only show in the standalone test scene.

